{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_43_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，齊人、陳人、曹人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_43_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"二、夏，單伯會伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_43_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"會，事之成也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_43_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，荊入蔡。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_43_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"荊者，楚也。其曰荊何也？州舉之也。州不如國，國不如名，名不如字。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_43_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"四、冬，單伯會齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯於鄄。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_43_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_43","textTraditional":"復同會也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}